WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.966
All right, Greninja, use Double Team.

2
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:14.700
Don't stop. Use bullet punch.

3
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.666
All right, aerial ace.

4
00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:28.433
Way to go!

5
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.966
Dedenne!

6
00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:32.066
- All right!
- Gren.

7
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:34.966
- Are you okay, Scizor?
- Scizor.

8
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.033
Great. Take a good rest.

9
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:40.133
Thank you, Scizor.

10
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.966
Your Greninja sure is strong.

11
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:44.300
Awesome moves.

12
00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:46.300
Fast and powerful.

13
00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:49.166
- Thank you very much.
- Pika.

14
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.300
Good work, Ash. What a great battle to have

15
00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:55.033
before your Snowbelle Gym Battle takes place.

16
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.000
- Yeah.
- Ash.

17
00:00:57.066 --> 00:00:59.900
I know you're going to win your gym battle.

18
00:00:59.966 --> 00:01:02.866
Thanks. That'll be my eighth Kalos Gym Badge.

19
00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:04.233
Pika, Pika!

20
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.300
- Huh?
- Huh?

21
00:01:05.366 --> 00:01:06.266
Pika?

22
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.033
It's been a while. How's it going, everyone?

23
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.266
Oh! Hey, it's Sawyer.

24
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:12.900
Pika!

25
00:01:17.966 --> 00:01:21.266
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

26
00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:25.200
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

27
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:29.100
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

28
00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:31.766
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

29
00:01:32.366 --> 00:01:33.433
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

30
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.666
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

31
00:01:36.733 --> 00:01:39.900
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

32
00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.233
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

33
00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.566
On their way to Snowbelle City,

34
00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:57.266
our heroes have run into their friend Sawyer,

35
00:01:57.333 --> 00:01:59.466
a young trainer who admires Ash.

36
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.800
- Huh? The Snowbelle Gym?
- Yeah.

37
00:02:03.233 --> 00:02:05.766
That's where I earned my eighth Gym Badge.

38
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:07.933
Wow, you got your eighth already?

39
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.199
Uh-huh.

40
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.166
Wow.

41
00:02:11.633 --> 00:02:12.800
That's so awesome.

42
00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:14.533
Sure is. Nice work.

43
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.266
I've still got seven. Guess you beat me to it.

44
00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:21.466
I was kind of jealous when I saw your badges before.

45
00:02:21.533 --> 00:02:23.000
I knew what I had to do.

46
00:02:24.066 --> 00:02:26.633
I had to work hard so I could catch up.

47
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:31.100
Well, I'm up next, and I'll win, too.

48
00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:34.500
Sawyer, so, what type of gym is the Snowbelle Gym?

49
00:02:34.566 --> 00:02:36.833
Snowbelle is an Ice-type gym.

50
00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.600
That means Water types should do really well.

51
00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:41.800
Then I'll use Greninja for the win.

52
00:02:41.866 --> 00:02:44.333
Since the two of you did so well against Diantha.

53
00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.100
Huh? You actually battled the champion?

54
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:50.466
Yup. She was using Mega Gardevoir, too.

55
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.966
- Dedenne.
- Pika, Pika.

56
00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:04.833
Uh-huh. It was great. Greninja and I merged while the battle was going.

57
00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.333
You merged?

58
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.000
Like that time back when we had our battle?

59
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.533
Not quite. It was more like...

60
00:03:18.366 --> 00:03:21.000
- It just really clicked.
- Huh?

61
00:03:21.066 --> 00:03:24.400
And Greninja had a big water shuriken on its back.

62
00:03:24.866 --> 00:03:26.100
Big water shuriken?

63
00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:29.000
And its head got all pointy-looking, like, voomp!

64
00:03:29.066 --> 00:03:30.933
And it was so totally cool.

65
00:03:31.566 --> 00:03:32.600
Voomp?

66
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.366
I don't think Sawyer quite understands what you mean.

67
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:37.700
So, why don't we just show you?

68
00:03:37.766 --> 00:03:39.866
Wanna battle with me and Greninja?

69
00:03:39.933 --> 00:03:43.400
Huh? You're on. So, how about...?

70
00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.233
- We should have a three-on-three battle.
- Huh?

71
00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.866
I wanna have a battle just like last time.

72
00:03:49.933 --> 00:03:53.000
I can see how much stronger I've gotten since then.

73
00:03:53.066 --> 00:03:55.333
I think that'd be a great way to see.

74
00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.833
You've got it, Sawyer.

75
00:04:05.866 --> 00:04:07.333
- Up ahead?
- Yeah.

76
00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.466
May?

77
00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.600
- Something?
- Huh?

78
00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:27.633
That's it. The sound we heard earlier.

79
00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.100
What's making it?

80
00:04:31.933 --> 00:04:33.433
It's getting closer.

81
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.100
The sound stopped.

82
00:04:47.266 --> 00:04:48.433
What is it?

83
00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:52.200
Run, everybody.

84
00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:05.533
Officer Jenny!

85
00:05:27.566 --> 00:05:29.166
Residual energy confirmed.

86
00:05:29.233 --> 00:05:31.533
Compared to the total amount of the discharge,

87
00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.066
it's three units higher than initial estimate.

88
00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.833
Discrepancy from planned output, 2 percent.

89
00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.466
Both are within the margin of error.

90
00:05:46.066 --> 00:05:47.566
Any damage to the cells?

91
00:05:48.166 --> 00:05:52.033
Negative. Their energy depletion level is greatly reduced.

92
00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.766
Results far exceed our expectations.

93
00:05:58.866 --> 00:06:01.866
I see. Continue the experiments.

94
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:05.866
- Make sure it's fully operational.
- Understood. Out.

95
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.233
Hmm.

96
00:06:16.633 --> 00:06:20.033
Heh. We'll need you a little further down the road.

97
00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:24.900
You. Answer me.

98
00:06:24.966 --> 00:06:28.300
What's wrong? Can you hear me? Are you safe?

99
00:06:29.433 --> 00:06:30.733
Squishy.

100
00:06:31.533 --> 00:06:34.333
Ash and Sawyer are going to battle.

101
00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.300
Dedenne.

102
00:06:36.366 --> 00:06:37.266
Huh?

103
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.700
Hey, what's wrong?

104
00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.833
Oh.

105
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.700
You're worried about someone.

106
00:06:45.766 --> 00:06:48.633
Don't worry. You always have us.

107
00:06:49.366 --> 00:06:53.833
♪ Squishy and me, nuzzling cheeks ♪

108
00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.400
♪ Best friends forever, we are so happy ♪

109
00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.900
♪ I'll care for you And always be with you ♪

110
00:07:01.966 --> 00:07:06.133
♪ Sweet little Squishy Here's my song for you ♪

111
00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.066
♪ My sweet Squishy, it's true ♪

112
00:07:09.133 --> 00:07:12.200
♪ My sweet Squishy, that's you ♪

113
00:07:16.933 --> 00:07:18.700
Hey, Ash, what's that thing?

114
00:07:19.366 --> 00:07:20.966
It's a Battle Pulse Meter.

115
00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:24.466
It monitors Ash and Greninja's emotional synchronization,

116
00:07:24.533 --> 00:07:27.133
essential for Greninja's powering up.

117
00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.133
Ah, that's great.

118
00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.466
- Okay. Ready?
- Ready.

119
00:07:35.766 --> 00:07:38.866
First one up is Doublade. Let's go!

120
00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:43.700
- Doublade!
- Check it out.

121
00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:51.066
Doublade, the Sword Pokémon, and the evolved form of Honedge.

122
00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:53.900
Doublade's attacks are so rapid and intricate,

123
00:07:53.966 --> 00:07:57.933
it is said to be impossible for even a master swordsman to stop them.

124
00:07:58.766 --> 00:08:01.733
Wow, guess Honedge evolved since our last battle.

125
00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.433
In that case, Noivern, I choose you!

126
00:08:11.766 --> 00:08:14.966
That's totally cool that your Noibat evolved, as well.

127
00:08:15.033 --> 00:08:15.900
Awesome.

128
00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.233
And it's gotten really strong.

129
00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.300
Noivern, use acrobatics.

130
00:08:29.533 --> 00:08:31.333
Doublade, iron defense.

131
00:08:31.833 --> 00:08:33.333
Doublade.

132
00:08:36.299 --> 00:08:38.866
Go on offense and use acrobatics again.

133
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.066
Use iron defense one more time.

134
00:08:45.133 --> 00:08:46.600
Doublade.

135
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:50.833
- Huh?
- It blocked it again.

136
00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:51.966
Dedenne?

137
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.633
Sawyer's plan is to exhaust Noivern

138
00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.700
by blocking all of its attacks using iron defense.

139
00:09:01.466 --> 00:09:02.533
Way to go.

140
00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.900
All right, Doublade, use slash.

141
00:09:04.966 --> 00:09:08.533
Blade, Doublade.

142
00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:14.500
Finish it up with night slash.

143
00:09:14.566 --> 00:09:15.633
Doublade.

144
00:09:24.366 --> 00:09:25.666
Use dragon claw.

145
00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.533
Doublade!
No, Doublade!

146
00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.000
Use acrobatics!

147
00:09:38.966 --> 00:09:40.300
Doublade!

148
00:09:46.233 --> 00:09:47.333
Ash won!

149
00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:51.066
Thanks, Doublade. You deserve a good rest.

150
00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:54.333
Noivern knew Doublade's position and exact timing.

151
00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.200
It attacked in the dust cloud.

152
00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.700
How did it know?

153
00:09:58.166 --> 00:10:01.033
Noivern was using sound waves the entire time.

154
00:10:02.533 --> 00:10:04.700
I get it. That's why...

155
00:10:04.766 --> 00:10:09.400
- I gotta make a note of this experience.
- Ready? Time for your next Pokémon.

156
00:10:09.866 --> 00:10:10.700
Right.

157
00:10:11.466 --> 00:10:12.533
Here we go.

158
00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.733
Clawitzer!

159
00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.200
Hey, that's...

160
00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.700
Clawitzer, the Howitzer Pokémon, and the evolved form of Clauncher.

161
00:10:24.766 --> 00:10:27.666
Clawitzer can travel at nearly 70 miles an hour,

162
00:10:27.733 --> 00:10:31.533
when it propels itself by shooting water from the back of its claw.

163
00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:32.900
Clawitzer, huh?

164
00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:34.566
This time, I'll win.

165
00:10:34.633 --> 00:10:37.166
Now, Clawitzer, use crabhammer.

166
00:10:37.633 --> 00:10:40.266
Clawitzer!

167
00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:42.300
Dodge it, then use boomburst.

168
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.066
You're gonna be fine. Heal pulse, go!

169
00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.066
-Wow, it's glowing.

170
00:10:59.133 --> 00:11:00.100
Dedenne.

171
00:11:00.166 --> 00:11:03.766
Right. Heal pulse is a move that restores a Pokémon's health.

172
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:07.133
It also worked with mega launcher, Clawitzer's ability.

173
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.500
- That's what helped it recover.
- No way.

174
00:11:09.566 --> 00:11:11.566
Noivern, use dragon claw.

175
00:11:14.466 --> 00:11:16.466
Clawitzer, use dragon pulse.

176
00:11:16.533 --> 00:11:18.966
Claw, Claw, Clawitzer.

177
00:11:21.766 --> 00:11:22.900
Noivern!

178
00:11:30.466 --> 00:11:31.900
All right!

179
00:11:32.366 --> 00:11:35.300
- Look at that.
- Was that its ability, too?

180
00:11:35.366 --> 00:11:38.500
Yes. It increases the power of aura and pulse moves.

181
00:11:38.966 --> 00:11:40.133
Thanks, Noivern.

182
00:11:41.133 --> 00:11:42.666
That battle was great.

183
00:11:43.666 --> 00:11:45.733
Hawlucha, I choose you.

184
00:11:50.766 --> 00:11:52.266
Lucha!

185
00:11:54.366 --> 00:11:56.233
Who's that Pokémon?"

186
00:12:01.833 --> 00:12:03.533
It's Doublade.

187
00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.900
Doublade!

188
00:12:10.533 --> 00:12:12.366
- Use dragon pulse.
- Dodge it!

189
00:12:14.633 --> 00:12:18.700
All right, mega launcher's impressive, but check this out.

190
00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:21.100
Grab it by the claw!

191
00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.033
I knew you were gonna do that, Ash.

192
00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.533
Clawitzer, use dragon pulse on the ground.

193
00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.000
Clawitzer!

194
00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.533
- How can it be flying?

195
00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.200
Wanna have a battle in the air, huh?

196
00:12:36.266 --> 00:12:38.000
Hawlucha, get above it.

197
00:12:40.266 --> 00:12:41.400
Huh?

198
00:12:41.466 --> 00:12:44.400
- Use flying press.
- Cha!

199
00:12:44.466 --> 00:12:45.366
Closer now.

200
00:12:46.666 --> 00:12:48.633
All right, ice beam. Let's go.

201
00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.333
Witzer!

202
00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.033
Haw, cha!

203
00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.266
Hawlucha!

204
00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:56.933
They were waiting for that.

205
00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.633
Ice beam's super effective against Hawlucha.

206
00:13:05.466 --> 00:13:08.300
Thanks, Hawlucha. You deserve a good rest.

207
00:13:08.366 --> 00:13:12.600
I was so worried about pulse moves that ice beam caught me off guard.

208
00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:16.433
I taught it to Clawitzer to deal with its disadvantage against Grass types.

209
00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.333
- I'm glad it worked.
- Claw.

210
00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.933
Clawitzer used Dragon Pulse to dodge instead of attacking,

211
00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:26.066
and dealt the final blow with ice beam, effective against Hawlucha.

212
00:13:26.133 --> 00:13:29.166
The way he called those moves was very precise.

213
00:13:29.233 --> 00:13:32.900
Sawyer studies really hard, and it shows.

214
00:13:33.833 --> 00:13:36.633
I can see why he won all eight Gym Badges.

215
00:13:37.166 --> 00:13:41.333
Wow, Sawyer's got so much more strength now than he had before.

216
00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.133
We can't let our guard down at all.

217
00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.933
- Hey, Greninja, are you ready to go?
- Gre.

218
00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.100
Ninja!

219
00:13:51.033 --> 00:13:52.033
Greninja.

220
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.933
This battle's gonna be great experience.

221
00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.700
We'll do our best.

222
00:13:56.766 --> 00:14:00.600
- Clawitzer, dragon pulse. Let's go.
- Clawitzer!

223
00:14:00.666 --> 00:14:01.533
Dodge it.

224
00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.233
Fast.

225
00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.200
Now what? Do we just go for it?

226
00:14:08.266 --> 00:14:10.533
What move is Sawyer gonna use next?

227
00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.333
Clawitzer, ice beam, go.

228
00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.566
Greninja, now use cut.

229
00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:29.900
Clawitzer!

230
00:14:29.966 --> 00:14:32.733
So strong, so fast, so cool.

231
00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.300
Dedenne!

232
00:14:34.366 --> 00:14:35.533
Clemont, what's up?

233
00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.733
Their battle pulses are still staying separate.

234
00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:41.533
It's not merging like against Diantha.

235
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.366
I wonder why.

236
00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:45.966
You were awesome, Clawitzer.

237
00:14:46.966 --> 00:14:48.566
Just leave the rest to us.

238
00:14:51.033 --> 00:14:52.866
Sceptile, now. Go!

239
00:14:54.266 --> 00:14:55.800
Sceptile!

240
00:14:57.766 --> 00:14:59.300
The battle's almost over.

241
00:14:59.366 --> 00:15:02.333
Time to really show you how strong I've become.

242
00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.100
So, get ready, Ash.

243
00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.133
Here we go.

244
00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.100
I know I've already won eight Gym Badges,

245
00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.833
but I'm up against Ash now. I've gotta beat him.

246
00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.400
It'll be proof I've become a full-fledged trainer.

247
00:15:17.466 --> 00:15:19.466
I've gotta make sure he knows it.

248
00:15:20.033 --> 00:15:23.100
Winning this battle is the best way to do it.

249
00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:26.233
You ready, Sceptile? Leaf blade, let's go!

250
00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.066
Scep!

251
00:15:28.133 --> 00:15:31.033
Now, it's time to show you what we're made of.

252
00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.800
All right, Greninja. Use aerial ace.

253
00:15:43.266 --> 00:15:44.600
Bullet seed, go.

254
00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.266
Use water shuriken.

255
00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.333
Now leaf blade.

256
00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.666
Double team, go.

257
00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.833
Weed it out with leaf blade.

258
00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.166
- So fast.
- Greninja's great at close range,

259
00:16:09.233 --> 00:16:11.500
- but they're taking it on anyway?
- Greninja.

260
00:16:11.566 --> 00:16:12.466
Now, use cut.

261
00:16:14.133 --> 00:16:15.400
Back away.

262
00:16:17.733 --> 00:16:19.166
Use leaf storm.

263
00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.833
No way!

264
00:16:31.266 --> 00:16:32.800
It stayed away this time.

265
00:16:32.866 --> 00:16:35.800
Sceptile is amazing close up and long range.

266
00:16:35.866 --> 00:16:37.433
You've gotta get up.

267
00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.266
- Pika, Pika!
- Ninja.

268
00:16:41.733 --> 00:16:43.300
You two are good.

269
00:16:44.266 --> 00:16:48.000
There are some things you can't know unless you have a battle.

270
00:16:48.066 --> 00:16:50.233
Sawyer's gotten really strong.

271
00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.900
It's obvious he must've trained really hard.

272
00:16:53.366 --> 00:16:56.400
Otherwise, he couldn't have gotten this strong so quickly.

273
00:16:56.833 --> 00:16:58.966
Being able to adapt to any situation

274
00:16:59.033 --> 00:17:01.300
and choose the most effective moves,

275
00:17:01.366 --> 00:17:03.933
I learned how to do all of that from Ash.

276
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.700
They've really surprised me.

277
00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.133
Greninja, aerial ace.

278
00:17:10.466 --> 00:17:11.300
Heads up.

279
00:17:25.466 --> 00:17:27.233
Greninja, here we go.

280
00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.600
All right, we're gonna battle as one.

281
00:17:31.933 --> 00:17:33.400
Ninja!

282
00:17:47.633 --> 00:17:49.100
It's not happening.

283
00:17:52.433 --> 00:17:53.700
The wave forms.

284
00:17:53.766 --> 00:17:55.000
They're separating.

285
00:17:55.066 --> 00:17:56.133
Huh?

286
00:17:58.033 --> 00:18:01.300
Wait. How did we do it in the first place?

287
00:18:02.766 --> 00:18:05.933
Huh? All right, Sceptile, use leaf storm.

288
00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.900
Sceptile!

289
00:18:10.566 --> 00:18:13.266
Greninja!

290
00:18:13.333 --> 00:18:15.033
- No, Greninja!
- Pika!

291
00:18:16.066 --> 00:18:17.833
Finish this with leaf blade.

292
00:18:36.233 --> 00:18:37.600
Sceptile.

293
00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.400
Greninja, are you okay?

294
00:18:41.466 --> 00:18:44.066
- Ninja.
- Pikachu!

295
00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:47.100
Guess we lost.

296
00:18:48.533 --> 00:18:51.033
We beat Greninja. We did it.

297
00:18:52.733 --> 00:18:54.166
Amazing. We won!

298
00:18:54.233 --> 00:18:57.033
- Sceptile, we really beat Ash!
- Sceptile!

299
00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:00.666
- I can't believe Ash lost.
- It happens sometimes.

300
00:19:00.733 --> 00:19:03.333
It's almost impossible to win every battle.

301
00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.200
And don't forget, Sawyer's gotten really strong.

302
00:19:06.266 --> 00:19:08.933
I can't imagine how hard he must have trained

303
00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.966
to become so strong so quickly.

304
00:19:11.433 --> 00:19:13.366
Thanks, Greninja. Now return.

305
00:19:17.233 --> 00:19:18.200
Pika, Pi.

306
00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.200
Sawyer got me good.

307
00:19:22.933 --> 00:19:24.200
Pi... Pika?

308
00:19:24.766 --> 00:19:25.600
Ash?

309
00:19:26.133 --> 00:19:28.900
Um, do you think I've gotten strong?

310
00:19:28.966 --> 00:19:31.166
Yeah, you're really strong.

311
00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.166
You surprised me.

312
00:19:44.733 --> 00:19:47.500
I wonder why we couldn't make it happen today.

313
00:19:47.566 --> 00:19:49.133
I really have no idea.

314
00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.766
Your battle pulses didn't overlap even once

315
00:19:51.833 --> 00:19:53.633
during the whole time.

316
00:19:54.233 --> 00:19:55.266
Hmm.

317
00:19:56.066 --> 00:19:59.633
Ah, forget it. No point making ourselves crazy.

318
00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:03.366
You'd better not get used to beating me, though.

319
00:20:04.166 --> 00:20:05.933
Okay.

320
00:20:06.833 --> 00:20:09.500
Let's get back on the road to the Snowbelle Gym.

321
00:20:09.566 --> 00:20:11.000
Pikachu!

322
00:20:11.466 --> 00:20:13.433
Do you think I could come along?

323
00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.000
It would be awesome to be there.

324
00:20:16.066 --> 00:20:19.566
Sure. You can watch me win my eighth Gym Badge.

325
00:20:19.633 --> 00:20:21.800
- Let's all go.
- Pika, Pika!

326
00:20:26.833 --> 00:20:28.966
Huh?

327
00:20:29.533 --> 00:20:32.733
Ah! Snowbelle City. There it is, up ahead.

328
00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:34.000
Pika, Pika!

329
00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.566
Our heroes are finally closing in on Snowbelle City,

330
00:20:38.633 --> 00:20:41.733
and Ash's battle to win his eighth Kalos Gym Badge

331
00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.333
is soon to begin, as the journey continues.
